# SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-only
# Robot to Robot's carriers (robot-to-robot-r0.md §4, §5; job L3): Tor, and the UnifiedPush connector with the part of
# Google's Tink its push encryption needs; All three come from Maven Central; Robot builds offline from a
# local copy of these files in third_party/maven-link/ (git-ignored; tools/fetch_link_deps.sh fills it, robot/README.md
# "Getting Tor and the push connector"), and every one is pinned here and in gradle/verification-metadata.xml
# (LinkCarrierPinsTest checks they agree).
#
#   tor-android 0.4.9.14 (Briar's build of Tor, BSD-3-Clause; OpenSSL 3.5.9 Apache-2.0 and zlib 1.3.2 inside): only its arm64
#     executable is used, never the jar on a classpath. The jar's line equals Maven Central's .sha256 for it.
#   (jtorctl 0.5, which R0 also fetched, isn't used: Robot speaks Tor's control protocol itself, TorControl.kt.)
#   connector 3.3.5 (UnifiedPush, Apache-2.0): registration, the receiver's decryption (RFC 8291) and, in its copy of Tink's
#     fixed_webpush, the sending side's encryption. Central publishes no .sha256 for it; its SHA-1,
#     c61a755bf12656bc6443d7fb5ce527e444d89277, matched Central's .sha1 when R0 downloaded it (21 Oct 2026).
#   tink 1.23.0 (Google, Apache-2.0): the connector reaches 11 of its classes (subtle EllipticCurves, EngineFactory, Hkdf,
#     Random, Bytes and their helpers, none of which needs protobuf), so protobuf-java is left out on purpose. Only the jar
#     (R0 kept no POM): the line equals Central's .sha256 for it.
#
# Paths are relative to third_party/maven-link/, so `sha256sum -c` runs there on the lines that start with a hash and "org/"
# or "com/".
3c282777bdcd3b55dcc8c8d5294af753dd8ed32b832f12e82128eed6f481d2ed  org/briarproject/tor-android/0.4.9.14/tor-android-0.4.9.14.jar
30eadd50240fecc903a7d3844891d1f8d3da2162fec8f76a831b64f13f5b2960  org/briarproject/tor-android/0.4.9.14/tor-android-0.4.9.14.pom
fa017cdfabbdc9af021e1f8c8eff2c8098e701d7a2c599937dce0b4ecf1e929b  org/unifiedpush/android/connector/3.3.5/connector-3.3.5.aar
bd5c29ee71cda841acf1ac867d4e5dc2817d6831ce2cc21b3d528d4e5aa903d7  org/unifiedpush/android/connector/3.3.5/connector-3.3.5.pom
9e56698a7d30802cb6f45adaec4171a19dd3827a1d022eeb567282315456e37b  org/unifiedpush/android/connector/3.3.5/connector-3.3.5.module
